OL,3,GNEWSAFood festival cancelled after 13
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual food festival has been axed
OL,7,Fafter 13 years due to rising costs.
OL,9,FShrewsbury Food Festival has been held
OL,10,Fin Quarry Park since 2013 but
OL,11,Forganisers said an increase in fuel
OL,12,Fprices, staffing and infrastructure
OL,13,Fcosts meant it was no longer viable.
OL,15,FTicket prices would have to be
OL,16,Fsignificantly increased but customers
OL,17,Fhaving less disposable income meant
OL,18,Fthis was not possible, Beth Heath of
OL,19,FShropshire Festivals said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
